  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Member of the Ashlords, Wis 13+.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per day, plus one time per 10 Fame you have achieved with the Ashlords, you can maximize the numeric results of a damaging power, spell, veil, or supernatural ability you use. If you choose to also take this damage yourself, the damage dealt ignores energy resistance of creatures impacted by the effect and deals half damage to creatures with immunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc68\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
